Falsifies `filesystem_contract::proofs::a_block_request_round_trips`.

The defect: `block::request` stores the count rather than the count minus one.

Expected to fail: `assert!(block::request_block_count(w0) == blocks)` for every count.

diff --git a/crates/filesystem_contract/src/block.rs b/crates/filesystem_contract/src/block.rs
